    "content": "<div class=\"gform-instructions\">\n  <h2>How to Complete This Menu Tracking Form</h2>\n  <p>This form documents one week of meals provided to an individual. Complete this form every three months to ensure proper nutritional care and meal variety.</p>\n\n  <details open>\n    <summary><strong>Step 1: Enter Basic Information</strong></summary>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>Name:</strong> Enter the full name of the individual receiving meals.</li>\n      <li><strong>Week Sampled:</strong> Enter the date range for the week being documented (e.g., \"12/1/2025 - 12/7/2025\").</li>\n      <li><strong>Provider:</strong> Enter the name of the meal provider or caregiver.</li>\n    </ol>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 2: Document Weekly Meals</strong></summary>\n    <p>Use the interactive meal planning grid below to record what was served each day.</p>\n    \n    <h3>For Each Day of the Week:</h3>\n    <p>Document meals in all four categories:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Breakfast:</strong> What was served for the morning meal</li>\n      <li><strong>Lunch:</strong> What was served for the midday meal</li>\n      <li><strong>Dinner:</strong> What was served for the evening meal</li>\n      <li><strong>Snacks:</strong> Any snacks provided throughout the day</li>\n    </ul>\n    \n    <h3>Meal Documentation Requirements:</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Write down specific foods and beverages served</li>\n      <li>Include main dishes, sides, and drinks</li>\n      <li>Be descriptive (e.g., \"Scrambled eggs, wheat toast, orange juice\" not just \"Breakfast\")</li>\n      <li>List multiple snacks if provided</li>\n      <li>Note any meal refusals or substitutions if relevant</li>\n    </ul>\n    \n    <h3>Nutritional Guidelines:</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Meals are to be <strong>wholesome and nutritious</strong></li>\n      <li>Individuals need to be provided with a <strong>choice of meals and snacks</strong></li>\n      <li>Ensure variety throughout the week</li>\n      <li>Consider dietary restrictions and preferences</li>\n    </ul>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 3: Review for Completeness</strong></summary>\n    <p>Before submitting, verify:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>All 7 days are documented (Monday through Sunday)</li>\n      <li>All 4 meal categories are filled in for each day</li>\n      <li>Meal descriptions are specific and detailed</li>\n      <li>Variety is shown across the week</li>\n      <li>Nutritious options are included</li>\n      <li>Choices are evident in the meal plan</li>\n    </ul>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 4: Submit Documentation</strong></summary>\n    <ol>\n      <li>Review all meal entries for accuracy</li>\n      <li>Ensure the week sampled dates are correct</li>\n      <li>Click <strong>Submit Menu Plan</strong></li>\n      <li>Keep confirmation for your records</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p style=\"background:#fff8dc;padding:10px;border-left:4px solid #ff9800;margin-top:10px\">\n      <strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> Documentation must be submitted to Real Care, Inc. <strong>no later than the 3rd of the following month</strong>.<br>\n      Submit to: <a href=\"mailto:documentation@realcarecolorado.com\">documentation@realcarecolorado.com</a> or call 303-284-5818 with questions.\n    </p>\n  </details>\n</div>",
