    "content": "<div style=\"padding:20px;background:#f5f5f5;border:2px solid #666;margin:20px 0;border-radius:5px\">\n  <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center\">Submission Information</h3>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6\">\n    <strong>Attn Provider / Caregiver:</strong> Please submit documentation from this appointment to Real Care, Inc. no later than the 3rd of the following month with monthly documentation.\n  </p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6\">\n    Documentation can be submitted to: <a href=\"mailto:documentation@realcarecolorado.com\" style=\"color:#0066cc;font-weight:bold\">documentation@realcarecolorado.com</a>\n  </p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6\">\n    Please contact Real Care, Inc. with any questions at <strong>303-284-5818</strong>.\n  </p>\n</div>",
